  "description": "2.0.40 - Adding contract management DTOs and Refit endpoints.\n      2.0.39 - Adding properties in the dto nota.\n      2.0.38 - Adjustment to email worker idempotency and removal of duplicate code in Refit dependency injection.\n      2.0.37 - Refactoring report payment slip\n      2.0.36 - Adding a report to the payment slip\n      2.0.35 - Payment slip control\n      2.0.34 - Transportation assets were added in this implementation\n      2.0.33 - Added a filter for the person in charge and adjusted the signed URL expiration time.\n      2.0.32 - Adding filter by person in charge\n      2.0.31 - Improve invoice control\n      2.0.30 - Implementation grade management\n      2.0.29 - Adding delete range method in the UnitOfWork\n      2.0.28 - Adding method remove in the bucket\n      2.0.27 - Improve confiration swagger ui\n      2.0.26 - Improves to health check\n      2.0.25 - Update jwt validation\n      2.0.24 - Adding property status to aprovacoes\n      2.0.23 - Adding Halth Check and Aproves\n      2.0.22 - Adding entry invoice tracker \n      2.0.21 - Adding asset history and edit asset\n      2.0.20 - Adding asset link\n      2.0.19 - Update NF generator\n      2.0.18 - Adding asset flow\n      2.0.17 - Validation flow to NF and TBe\n      2.0.16 - NF report and TBe report\n      2.0.15 - New details to logs configuration\n      2.0.14 - Adding iten devolutment\n      2.0.13 - New features to download pdf nf and new features in the detail list nf\n      2.0.12 - Improve invoice tracker\n      2.0.11 - Adding invoice tracker\n      2.0.10 - Adding context to identify user operations\n      2.0.9 - Add report by id user\n      2.0.8 - Improve upload implementation and process to create ficha\n      2.0.7 - Add upload file\n      2.0.6 - Alining with frontend\n      2.0.5 - Add new query method\n      2.0.4 - Add EPI register\n      2.0.3 - Update Cache\n      2.0.2 - Add TBe validate\n      2.0.1 - Add DI RefitClientCredentials\n      2.0.0 - Configuration API BFF\n      1.1.7 - Add configuration for work with Redis\n      1.1.6 - Clean Arquitecture Refactoring\n      1.1.5 - Add get async method\n      1.1.4 - Configuration params authentication\n      1.1.3 - Add custon messages\n      1.1.2 - Setting kibana logs\n      1.1.1 - Logging and cache configuration",
